WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:38.570
Damido of the Buff Clan launched
 one last attack on the Solo Ship,

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.280
but fell before the power of the Ideon.

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:48.060
However, Cosmo and Kasha ignored Bes's orders,
 temporarily putting the ship into danger.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:51.200
They were imprisoned in place of Karala.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:57.580
The Solo Ship landed on a new
planet inhabited by ape men.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:10.690
<b>Violent Battle on the Ape Planet</b>

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.500
Don't speed up so abruptly!

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:39.760
Ideo-Nova, you're swaying!

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:41.010
That's not true!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.640
Get into docking formation!

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.510
Roger! Hey! Did you get that?

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:51.410
That Bes! He really intends to replace us!

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:56.110
I don't want to leave other people in charge of my safety.

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:59.320
Then you have to listen to Bes' orders.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.650
Being bossed around is even more frustrating!

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:18.840
We'll reach the Dorowa Zan in five
 minutes. Everyone, prepare for contact!

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:24.590
It seems that Lady Harulu still has
her hands full with the Giant.

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:26.560
I must show her the results of my investigation.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.520
I've lost!

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:47.740
Next!

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:50.150
Allow me.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.620
Very well. Come on!

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:56.330
Excuse me!

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.810
Your skills have improved, Gije.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.140
Thank you very much.

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:25.120
Could you tell me the results of your research
 into the Ide on Logo Dau right away?

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:25.940
Yes ma'am!

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.090
Bes!

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:29.360
What is it, Lotta?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.570
Lou's got a fever again...

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:35.030
His temperature has changed,

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:37.750
but it seems different from a cold.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.160
It isn't a cold?

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:43.160
Isn't there a nurse?

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:57.520
40 degrees... That's quite bad.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:00.500
He needs a vaccine for measles, quickly.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.230
Has Lou got the measles?

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:05.950
It seems that way.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.620
I didn't know that disease still existed...

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.610
What'll happen if someone gets the measles?

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.430
If we don't do something, he could die.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:14.390
Die?

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:17.580
Yes... It's dangerous if this high fever
 continues for more than four days...

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:19.280
He'll die...

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.080
Bes.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:26.170
This means we must go to a planet that has the vaccine.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:29.010
There could be some other way.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:29.820
Try to find something.

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:32.520
Yes, it'd be nice if that was true...

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:36.330
This is the spot where the Logo
Dau aliens ship was buried.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.730
And this is the spot where
the Giant machines were.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:43.440
From these spots, we discovered traces of some 
sort of energy that was emitted in all directions.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.230
Energy?

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:44.890
Yes.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:50.940
This is a trail left behind by the energy, 
 discovered from beneath the ground.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:56.990
They even go through the other side of Logo Dau.

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:58.790
Is this the Ide's energy?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.130
Turn it off.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:00.960
Most likely.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.210
Does this mean you don't
know what the Ide itself is?

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.420
Correct. All that we know is...

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:11.470
The Ide's energy exists in the
 machines that the aliens dug up?

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:16.730
Perhaps those machines were
meant to control the power of Ide.

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:22.650
We must use all our might to get them.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:23.400
Yes.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:24.850
However, Gije...

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:29.320
Is it really possible that such a small ship...

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:32.950
...could contain energy capable
of destroying the universe itself?

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.320
How long is it going to take?

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:41.170
The docking isn't working well,

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:44.750
and some of the missile launchers
 and Glen Cannons are damaged...

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:44.750
Bes!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:45.790
Make it fast!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:46.590
What is it?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:47.830
Take a look at this.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:51.840
This is the Ideon's power output
compared to the pilot's brain waves.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.340
There's a connection.

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:56.570
Especially during the last battle,
when Deck was piloting, right?

00:06:56.570 --> 00:07:00.020
Now that you mention it, Cosmo said there
 was a large change in the power output...

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:03.430
Does the Ideon's power depend
on the number of pilots?

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:15.400
Sir Gije, we're ready to launch.

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:17.740
Well then, Lady Harulu,

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.490
I shall capture one of the
Giant machines for you.

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:25.750
It seems you're no longer obsessed with Karala, Gije.

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:54.450
Listen up! Since we have been
 bestowed with this grand fleet today,

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.200
we must not let down Lady Harulu's trust!

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:57.530
Yes sir!

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:01.080
With the Zero Zurow's hooks 
and the Zigg Mack's weaponry,

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.710
the Giant will certainly fall to us.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:11.520
I was separated from my parents as a little child,

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:15.340
and grew up on a horrible planet
 which only had summer and winter.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.680
What're you doing? Are you listening to me?

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.640
Yeah.

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.140
Even though Planet Solo was still under development,

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:25.030
it was heaven compared to where I grew up, A92.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:27.030
Hey, what're you doing!?

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:29.850
I'm trying to dig a hole here.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:32.150
Well, it seems impossible.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.190
Your meals.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.530
Oh? We can finally eat?

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:38.120
Huh? That's all?

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.160
It's your punishment.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.410
What do you mean, punishment?

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:43.510
Just being here is humiliating enough!

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:45.570
Hey, Lin, go talk to Bes!

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:48.140
Kasha, you're mistaken.

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:51.920
You're being punished because
 everyone expects a lot from you two.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.360
What do you know? You alien!

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:56.510
Kasha, you're going too far.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.490
It's okay, Lin.

00:08:57.490 --> 00:09:00.890
Being inside that cage would make
 anyone lose their nerves or go mad.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.490
I'm only annoyed!

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:05.030
This might help you grow as a person.

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:08.890
We can understand how you feel.
 You're a a strong kid after all.

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:11.750
That's right, Kasha's a strong kid!

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.270
Don't make fun of me!

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:16.860
Kasha, you'll only get this bread 3 times a day.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.350
Stop messing with me!

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:21.160
Well then, I have to go. I'm worried about Lou.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:21.780
Yes.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:24.320
What happened?

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:27.210
He's sick. It's the measles.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.630
Measles? What?

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.130
He'll die without a vaccine.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:49.730
The electrical systems on the
left side are badly connected!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.320
We need to leave this planet soon, so hurry!

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.950
Bes, it's planet Ajian!

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:56.150
Can you contact them?

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.000
- Yeah!
- The enemy!

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.100
What?!

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:00.320
The enemy's coming from the
third northeast battle line!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.610
It's a big squadron!

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:04.200
Dock the Ideon and launch it!

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.720
Wait five more minutes!

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:08.880
We can't wait!

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.790
Prepare to launch each unit!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.830
The Solo Ship will prepare its anti-aircraft fire!

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:25.810
Ideo-Nova, Ideo-Buster, hurry!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.590
Open the Solo Ship main cannon!

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:30.570
How can they have inexperienced people fight?!

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.830
Their squadron is that big?

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:41.970
Can we do it?

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.280
We've got no choice!

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:48.120
They're firing!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.870
Fire back! Fire back at them!

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:52.330
Solo Ship! Cover all Ideon units!

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:02.170
One Zigg Mack, three Zurow Jicks,
hold down the enemy units!

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.430
We've been hit!

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:28.700
What is the Ideon doing?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.450
They're getting beaten by the Buff Clan!

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:34.700
Okay, the rest of you! Prevent
the Ideon from docking!

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:39.960
I'll test the unknown particles we found
 buried in the ground of Logo Dau!

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:46.820
I got hit!

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:48.970
Relax! We're being protected by the barrier!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:52.190
Fly under the enemy and I'll shoot them!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:55.010
Go down! Go down!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.920
The enemy's behind us! Shake them off!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.130
Easy to say!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.040
Do you want to die?!

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:27.350
This is hopeless!

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:28.500
Don't falter!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:33.130
I'll smash you! Damn Giant!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.780
Contact all the Ideon units!

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.900
Tell them they can't beat the enemy by running around!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:46.610
It's impossible! They're not as experienced as Cosmo!

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:50.490
Karala! Help me.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:51.110
Yes!

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:54.910
Insert these plugs into
the same colored sockets.

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:55.700
Yes.

00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:58.620
Thanks.

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:02.510
What is this?

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.760
The Ideon Gauge's reaction is low.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.470
Don't you think that's strange?

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:11.430
Get close to the Ideon machines!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:12.840
Then use the DS Drive!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.230
We're escaping to planet Ajian!

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:15.980
Bes!

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:16.480
What?!

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:20.520
Piper Lou's temperature is
rising! Please do something!

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.900
Hatari! Proceed!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.320
Lou's gonna die!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.640
At this rate, everyone will die!

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:29.280
Bes, get close to the enemy's
Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:29.780
Karala!

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.370
If we can distract the enemy even for a moment,

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.790
the Ideon units will be able to land!

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:37.410
Karala! Did you just call the Buff Clan the enemy?

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:42.540
If we can get Cosmo and the
others to fight in the Ideon,

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:45.010
then we should be able to activate the DS Drive.

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:48.550
Could you project a laser image of me?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:03.360
We did it!

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:05.590
How's it going out there?

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:06.630
It's very dangerous.

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:07.320
Kasha!

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.380
I refuse!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.230
There's no time for complaints!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:12.160
You're too simple minded, Cosmo!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:15.920
Even if we are victorious,
they'll put us back here!

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:18.160
Kasha! Now is not the time for this!

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:21.830
I'm not Bes and Sheryl's slave! I'm no puppet!

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:23.920
If I'm gonna die, I may as well right here!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.670
Kasha! Don't you want to fight the Buff Clan?

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.130
I'm going.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.140
Kasha!

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.820
Lou has measles!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:34.720
If we don't get out of here
and get him treatment...

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:38.630
It doesn't matter if he's sick if
the Solo Ship gets destroyed, right?

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:41.060
I know how you feel, Kasha,

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.650
but if we don't strive for survival
 together, we're all going to die.

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:46.860
What do you mean?

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:51.300
You can't win the whole battle on
 your own. The same goes for Cosmo.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:54.590
He must be in trouble without you.

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:57.790
Why did you lock me up here then?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.820
That's because we want to make you understand.

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:02.880
Ready the laser projector!

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:18.600
We're behind their back! Use the Claw attack!

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.220
They got us!

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:23.190
It's over!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.790
Stop your engine!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.310
If you don't, we'll use the particle cannon!

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:28.400
What the?!

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:34.270
Who is the commander of this attack?

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:45.490
We have a dying baby on our ship.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:48.750
I appeal to your mercy as a samurai,
please agree to a cease fire!

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:52.190
I see, it's a laser projection!

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:53.590
An alien trick!

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:54.840
Turn 180 degrees!

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:55.470
Yes sir!

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:59.060
I acknowledge that it is against
 the code of the Buff Clan...

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.280
Karala, that's enough.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:02.580
Bes, Cosmo and Kasha are heading out!

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.020
The Ideo-Delta is about to land.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.150
Cosmo, do you hear me?

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:06.760
I'm on the deck now!

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:11.480
Good!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:12.980
I'm counting on you!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.530
The Ideo-Nova is being chased!

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:19.200
Roger! Get me a spare helmet.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:23.890
Here's your helmet.

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:26.540
Okay, Ideo-Buster, follow me!

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.600
Kasha's here now. Just a moment.

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:29.750
Kasha?!

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:32.010
Chase after them! I'll go behind you!

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:33.420
Roger!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.430
Look, Cosmo!

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:37.260
Behind us!

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:41.680
The Ideo-Nova! Is it over there?

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:44.760
I won't let you get near!

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:52.720
Cosmo! I've caught up!

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.520
Kasha! Thanks.

00:16:58.170 --> 00:16:59.440
The gauge isn't on?

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:07.020
Their movements have changed!

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:08.960
Retreat and let them dock!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:11.500
We'll stop the Giant's docking process!

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:16.030
The enemy is retreating!

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:17.300
Let's dock!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:18.800
Why won't the power go up?

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:30.720
It's not rising?

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.190
Zigg Macks! Let's go!

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:37.410
Prevent them from docking and
capture the Giant machines!

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:51.080
Is the barrier being broken?

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:54.210
Cosmo! The docking power is going down too!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:58.130
We can't dock!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:00.170
Watch out, they're coming!

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.640
It's just as I thought!

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:07.100
Those particles found on Logo
Dau have broken their barrier!

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:09.480
Catch the falling unit!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:10.650
It's easy prey!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.990
Moera! They caught us!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.530
And we can't transform!

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:21.530
Good!

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:25.280
I'll take care of the rest, bring
that one back to the Dorowa Zan!

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:29.250
I won't let you do that! Kasha, hurry up!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.240
Roger!

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:34.430
We'll take on the fighters!

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:36.760
Cosmo and Kasha, retrieve the Ideo-Nova!

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:50.180
We can't do anything to help them.

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.610
Ah! This is pitiful!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.610
I wish we could fight too...

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:58.940
How strange. The Ideon
Gauge isn't shining like usual...

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:02.570
Bes! We have to start the DS Drive
and escape from this planet!

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:06.490
I intend to do that! Cosmo and
Kasha are trying their best!

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:15.740
Ascend and turn 180 degrees!

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:17.060
Never mind the others!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:18.630
Saving the Ideo-Nova is our priority!

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:19.800
Roger!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.260
I'm going to launch an attack.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.460
Then I'll sneak in and dock!

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:33.800
Here we go!

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:46.570
11th Missile Block, fire!

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:55.000
Kasha! Let's dock!

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:16.520
They couldn't have!

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.940
Sir! We lost the second engine!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:19.610
They're coming!

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:20.730
Fire the particle cannon!

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:26.220
Speed up! Shoot them down!

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:29.070
The power won't rise in the legs, it's overheating!

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:31.250
The Ideon Gauge isn't powering up either!

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.780
Raise the output to maximum!

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.340
Damn you!

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:50.210
It doesn't matter! Escape!

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:17.410
Destination, planet Ajian! Enter DS Drive!

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:33.910
The Logo Dau aliens have entered subspace!

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.370
Can we follow them?

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:37.640
Yes! The tracking device is still active!

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:42.350
That Gije, he let them escape again!

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:45.230
Once Gije's squadron has returned, we'll go after them!

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:49.530
Is Gije a worthless man?

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:51.780
Or is the Giant simply too powerful?

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:02.420
Why did you decide to help?

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.880
I don't know.

00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:08.420
Maybe I just want to end this as soon as possible.

00:22:08.780 --> 00:22:12.010
Running away all the time is just sad.

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:14.860
We can't protect ourselves like this.

00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:15.880
That's right...

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:36.820
Will the vaccine for Lou's measles be
on the Earth immigrant Planet Ajian?

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:42.660
And will they be able to get away
from the Buff Clan's pursuit?

00:22:51.740 --> 00:22:57.560
<i>After an attack from the Buff Clan, colony planet
 Ajian tries to destroy the Solo Ship.</i>

00:22:58.370 --> 00:23:01.650
<i>Due to strong measures taken by the Buff Clan's Gije,</i>

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>the Solo Ship is isolated from allies.</i>

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:08.850
<i>Will the sublight missiles make
this the last stand for the Ideon?</i>

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:14.320
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant 
Ideon: "Betrayal on Ajian."</i>

00:23:13.570 --> 00:23:17.620
<b>Betrayal on Ajian</b>

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.150
<i><i>Space Runaway!</i></i>

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:35.640
tatta hitotsu no hoshi ni suterare

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:35.640
<i>I've been abandoned merely by one world</i>

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:42.980
owarinai tabi kimi to ayumu to

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:42.980
<i>As I walk this endless journey together with you</i>

00:23:43.270 --> 00:23:48.530
itsukushimi futo wakeatte

00:23:43.270 --> 00:23:48.530
<i>We unexpectedly share our affection</i>

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:55.910
kizu wo nameau douke shibai

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:55.910
<i>Feeling sympathy for each other in this farcical play</i>

00:23:56.240 --> 00:24:02.000
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:23:56.240 --> 00:24:02.000
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:08.590
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:08.590
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:14.550
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:14.550
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:21.930
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:21.930
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>
